End-to-End Flow Summary
Terraform (libvirt provider)
  → provisions 1 master + N workers (Ubuntu 22.04 KVM VMs)
  → generates Ansible inventory

Ansible playbook (4 sequential plays)
  → Docker + containerd → K8s prerequisites → kubeadm init master → kubeadm join workers
  → Calico CNI (Tigera operator)
  → Cluster ready, ~/.kube/config on master

Direct kubectl OR ArgoCD (GitOps)
  → Namespace + quota + NetworkPolicy + RBAC + PDBs + HPA (k8s/apps/base/)
  → Vault + setup Job + vault-root-token Secret (out-of-band bootstrap)
  → Per-service Deployments (2 replicas, hardened security contexts)
  → Istio CRDs + Flagger (canary deployments)
  → ServiceMonitors → Prometheus Operator → Prometheus
  → Loki + Promtail + Grafana + Alertmanager + SLO rules
  → 3 FastAPI microservices running (users/products/orders) with Vault secret injection

CI/CD (GitHub Actions)
  → lint → gitleaks → test → build+publish to ghcr.io → trivy scan → deploy (manual gate)